<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Ghana Gold in A$10 mln placement.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Ghana Gold in A$10 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana Gold Mines Ltd said on Monday it had made a private placement through Prudential Bache of 50 million shares at 20 cents per share to raise A$10 million for further exploration and development.</p>
<p>Ghana Gold Mines' shares were four cents higher at 26 cents on Monday just before the close.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
